      "Notes": "\"Chain Reaction!\" A 8+ pip damage spell on him while Hisamoto stands: Smoke Screen, then Hisamoto's Rebirth, then Kensaburo's Sirens. New blocks: these allies, an ally casts. \"A {pips} pip\" is read as {pips} or more (a guess)." },

